# corpus/mac/secure_field_passthrough_01 — S3 secure input (AXSecureTextField) → mọi phím PASS (từ có marker Telex — phân biệt được với không-secure) (P2-5 §2)
:config method=telex diacritic_style=new
:app com.apple.safari field=editbox

:secure on
:type "duocj321"
:expect "duocj321"
:expect_action PASS
